Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:52.02,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,This is the preview of the next episode of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:53.98,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Iceblade Sorcerer \NShall Rule the World!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:57.20,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,The girl who sheds the tears of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:24:00.33,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,The turbulent skies that envelope everything \Nas if in concert with her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:02.57,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,The beautiful lily goes into bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:06.24,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest \NSorcerer Resonates With the Past"!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.46,0:24:09.97,ep title,txt,0,0,0,,Episode 11\N{\fscx80}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Resonates with the Past
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.62,0:24:08.85,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,This has been your very own Lily White!
